abc-bottle-gym
Copyright the abc-bottle-gym contributors.

This project is a standalone, torch-free extraction of the "put bottles in
bin" MuJoCo task from the ABC project (https://github.com/amazon-far/abc,
https://abc.bot), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (see
LICENSE). Scene/task Python code (src/abc_bottle_gym/config.py, scene.py,
env.py, sim.py) is adapted from `abc_minimal/config.py` and
`abc_minimal/eval_policy.py` in that project; the physics, rendering,
scene-randomization, and success-metric logic is reproduced unmodified in
substance, running on the same MuJoCo-Warp (`mujoco-warp` + `warp-lang`)
GPU simulator/renderer the original uses by default, to avoid the
distribution shift a different renderer would introduce for any policy
trained on MJWarp-rendered images. `torch`, the DiT policy, CLIP, DINOv3,
and `viser` (all needed only to load/run a trained policy, not the
environment itself) were dropped.

